.Dd September 17, 2026
.Dt ARCSYNC 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm arcsync
.Nd archive a photo library to a hybrid CD/DVD ISO
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl nqv
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -dir Ar path | Fl -library Ar path
.Op Fl -out Ar path
.Op Fl -media Ar type
.Op Fl -split
.Op Fl -burn
.Op Fl -cloud Ar mode
.Op Fl -help
.Op Fl -version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
copies photos into a dated
.Pa media/YYYY/MM/DD/
tree, builds a static HTML gallery, and writes a hybrid ISO via
.Xr hdiutil 1 .
With
.Fl -burn ,
it then runs
.Nm hdiutil burn
on the ISO.
.Sh ICLOUD AND OPTIMIZED LIBRARIES
.Nm
copies files that are already on this Mac. It does not download from iCloud.
For family libraries using Optimize Mac Storage, run:
.Pp
.Dl arcsync -n --cloud fail
.Pp
then set Photos to Download Originals to this Mac overnight, re-check with dry-run,
then burn with
.Fl -cloud fail .
See the PRD for the full overnight recipe.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It 0
Success
.It 1
Usage error
.It 2
Library unreadable / schema unrecognized
.It 3
No assets matched
.It 4
Staging I/O error
.It 5
Over capacity without
.Fl -split
.It 6
hdiutil failed
.It 8
.Fl -cloud fail
and non-local originals present
.El
